Mom, I'm so thirsty.

175
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:30,320
I want some water.

176
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,240
Thirsty?

177
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,900
Come, Iet's go get some water.

178
