214
00:21:24,270 --> 00:21:25,480
At this point,

215
00:21:26,350 --> 00:21:27,830
I have nothing to hide.

216
00:21:28,550 --> 00:21:31,350
To bring down the Murongs and the Lis,

217
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:34,760
our Zhang family has
put years of painstaking effort

218
00:21:34,760 --> 00:21:36,290
