To prevent him from finding any clues,

236
00:22:12,110 --> 00:22:14,000
I had to eradicate the root.

237
00:22:17,030 --> 00:22:20,090
Because the Murong and Li babies
were swapped at birth,

238
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:23,570
Li Rongzhang always refused to
make an enemy of the Murongs.

239
00:22:23,900 --> 00:22:25,480
I could only drag him down,

240
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:28,000
to share the profits with me.

241
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:35,270
Who knew that this matter

242
00:22:36,110 --> 00:22:38,510
would be discovered by Murong Qingyu?

243
00:22:51,140 --> 00:22:53,240
So I killed Huo Zongqi

244
00:22:53,310 --> 00:22:54,960
and framed Ren Susu

245
00:22:55,230 --> 00:22:57,730
