turn against each other.

246
00:22:57,730 --> 00:23:00,780
[Marriage Notice:
Murong Qingyu & Fang Mulan]

247
00:22:58,590 --> 00:23:00,920
And on the eve of Murong Qingyu's wedding,

248
00:23:01,270 --> 00:23:02,920
