281
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:27,210
So destroying it on the spot
is the best solution.

282
00:25:27,310 --> 00:25:28,070
Put it in.

283
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:30,960
Murong Qingyi,

284
00:26:31,750 --> 00:26:33,400
what about Ren Susu?

285
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,550
If you leave now,

286
00:26:39,070 --> 00:26:40,670
you can still live to see her.

287
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:43,110
Otherwise...

288
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:52,030
you'll die here with me.

289
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:55,590
Think about it.

290
00:26:57,590 --> 00:26:59,520
Is it worth throwing your life away

291
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,640
for those irrelevant people?

292
00:27:48,110 --> 00:27:49,910
Those who were persecuted by you

293
00:27:50,510 --> 00:27:51,880
and lost their lives,

294
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:54,760
are they irrelevant people too?

295
00:28:28,270 --> 00:28:29,070
This punch

296
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:31,070
is for Laiyi.

297
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:37,400
This punch

298
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:39,160
is for Boze.

299
00:28:43,510 --> 00:28:44,720
This last punch...

300
00:28:51,830 --> 00:28:53,400
is for my elder brother!

301
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:07,420
♪ This spark of wildfire
spreading across the plains ♪

302
00:29:08,150 --> 00:29:11,140
♪ Stirs embers that refuse to fade ♪

303
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:14,930
♪ I seize fate by the hand ♪

304
00:29:15,040 --> 00:29:18,410
♪ Accusing it of refusing to relent ♪

305
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:21,790
♪ Pain and joy blur before my eyes ♪

306
00:29:22,550 --> 00:29:25,980
♪ Fate keeps replaying its endless cycle ♪

307
00:29:26,230 --> 00:29:31,560
♪ The love that refused to die ♪

308
00:29:31,460 --> 00:29:32,810
This is spectacular!

309
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:36,700
♪ Has already consumed us both ♪

310
00:29:52,590 --> 00:29:53,440
Qingyi,

311
00:29:54,010 --> 00:29:55,350
do you see this?

312
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:57,960
We've succeeded.

313
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:35,680
Qingyu...

314
00:30:47,030 --> 00:30:48,240
Boze...

315
00:31:03,070 --> 00:31:04,160
Father...

316
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:13,440
Ms. Ye...

317
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:24,240
Laiyi...

318
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:31,550
Let these brilliant fireworks...

319
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:36,240
pay tribute to your loyal souls.

320
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:55,610
[Butterfly Crisp]

321
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:01,900
Was anyone waiting around here just now?

322
00:32:01,930 --> 00:32:07,060
[Butterfly Crisp]

323
00:32:02,350 --> 00:32:03,350
No.

324
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:07,270
Come and take a look!

325
00:32:07,550 --> 00:32:08,310
Miss.

326
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:10,920
Are you Ren Susu?

327
00:32:11,270 --> 00:32:13,070
A man asked me to give this to you.

328
00:32:14,750 --> 00:32:15,550
Where is he?

329
00:32:16,720 --> 00:32:19,200
He gave me a few silver dollars
early in the morning

330
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:22,400
and told me to wait for you at the
City God Temple's butterfly crisp stand.

331
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,160
I don't know where he is either.

332
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:27,510
He said he's leaving for a while to do

333
00:32:27,830 --> 00:32:29,360
something very important,

334
00:32:29,780 --> 00:32:32,110
and that you should take care of yourself.

335
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:03,400
Qingyi.

336
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:46,440
Qingyi,

337
00:33:47,110 --> 00:33:47,790
stand up.

338
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:50,160
Hurry now.

339
00:33:51,030 --> 00:33:51,720
Stand up!

340
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,310
You brat,

341
00:34:02,750 --> 00:34:04,150
what are you waiting for?

342
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:07,930
Susu and Le'an are waiting for you.

343
00:34:22,710 --> 00:34:23,440
Susu,

344
00:34:24,710 --> 00:34:26,570
passing through the raging fire,

345
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,320
we become sparks,

346
00:34:30,710 --> 00:34:31,960
not the ashes.

347
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,190
If this time

348
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,280
I don't return,

349
00:34:39,280 --> 00:34:40,710
you must live well.

350
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,510
Live for yourself.

351
00:34:52,670 --> 00:34:53,840
In the past,

352
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:56,400
it was always me waiting for you.

353
00:34:57,870 --> 00:34:58,840
This time,

354
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:01,750
it's your turn to wait for me.

355
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,150
Okay?

356
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:16,150
Okay.

357
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,280
Okay.

358
00:35:20,510 --> 00:35:21,590
This time...

359
00:35:24,510 --> 00:35:26,070
I'll wait for you.

360
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:31,630
Susu.

361
00:35:33,110 --> 00:35:34,590
Waiting is torturous,

362
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:36,840
but it also carries hope.

363
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:40,710
You have a long life ahead.

364
00:35:41,710 --> 00:35:42,920
This might be

365
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:45,230
the last thing I can do for you.

366
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:52,110
I often wonder:

367
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:55,760
if we could return to that second

368
00:35:56,550 --> 00:35:58,080
and start all over again...

369
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:02,760
what kind of life would we've lived?

370
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,550
There must be such a universe.

371
00:36:53,640 --> 00:36:55,400
Qingyu and Ms. Ye

372
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:58,230
will tie the knot
and spread their wings freely.

373
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:04,540
Congratulations!

374
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:08,610
Boze and Hai Tangqing
will be in perfect harmony,

375
00:37:08,720 --> 00:37:10,180
two hearts beating as one.

376
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:15,450
And the frozen soil in Mother's heart

377
00:37:15,450 --> 00:37:17,360
will be melted by her own spring.

378
00:37:19,070 --> 00:37:21,480
She'll finally use her unconsumed love

379
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:24,630
to illuminate each of us equally.

380
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,480
Hands off! It's mine!

381
00:37:48,190 --> 00:37:49,720
Don't mess things up for me!

382
00:37:50,670 --> 00:37:51,320
Susu,

383
00:37:52,710 --> 00:37:54,170
let me take you somewhere.

384
00:38:03,790 --> 00:38:05,750
[27 Liuli Alley, East District]

385
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:32,590
And we will

386
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:36,070
meet in the first snow of Beicheng.

387
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:39,150
I'll be a doctor,

388
00:38:39,630 --> 00:38:40,960
and you'll be a painter.

389
00:38:48,770 --> 00:38:50,670
♪ I happened to ♪

390
00:38:50,690 --> 00:38:52,580
♪ Hear your name ♪

391
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:53,630
We might argue over

392
00:38:53,860 --> 00:38:55,760
♪ And all the memories ♪

393
00:38:54,190 --> 00:38:56,030
the unwatered gentian flowers

394
00:38:55,780 --> 00:38:58,690
♪ Came flooding back ♪

395
00:38:57,030 --> 00:38:58,670
and the uncleaned swing.

396
00:38:59,500 --> 00:39:01,430
♪ There I stood in the falling snow ♪

397
00:38:59,710 --> 00:39:00,800
Then, we'll

398
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:04,280
make up because of
the smell of braised pork in the kitchen.

399
00:39:01,450 --> 00:39:03,900
♪ Wrapped in my coat ♪

400
00:39:04,420 --> 00:39:06,600
♪ My heart pounding ♪

401
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:10,770
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

402
00:39:10,790 --> 00:39:12,670
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

403
00:39:13,990 --> 00:39:15,780
♪ In the misty train car ♪

404
00:39:14,510 --> 00:39:17,190
You'll smile at me,
with a butterfly crisp in your hands.

405
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:20,170
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

406
00:39:19,400 --> 00:39:20,710
This time,

407
00:39:20,390 --> 00:39:24,460
♪ If you have any ♪

408
00:39:22,230 --> 00:39:24,670
we can afford to
waste our lives in such trivial ways.

409
00:39:24,550 --> 00:39:26,650
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

410
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:32,330
♪ Memories are like falling into a trap ♪

411
00:39:32,350 --> 00:39:34,580
♪ Full of mud ♪

412
00:39:34,600 --> 00:39:36,710
♪ The more I struggle,
the more suffocated I become ♪

413
00:39:36,030 --> 00:39:36,840
We made it!

414
00:39:37,080 --> 00:39:39,830
♪ But I couldn't resist collecting them ♪

415
00:39:38,230 --> 00:39:39,320
Come on, get on.

416
00:39:39,850 --> 00:39:42,400
♪ I keep collecting ♪

417
00:39:42,530 --> 00:39:45,260
♪ Every word and comment ♪

418
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:47,410
♪ They speak of you ♪

419
00:39:47,430 --> 00:39:49,930
♪ You're becoming clear ♪

420
00:39:50,030 --> 00:39:51,970
♪ So far yet so clear ♪

421
00:39:52,420 --> 00:39:55,080
♪ Ever since forgetting you ♪

422
00:39:55,190 --> 00:39:57,730
♪ Became second nature ♪

423
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,190
You're squeezing my hand.

424
00:39:59,180 --> 00:40:00,850
♪ I still can't erase ♪

425
00:40:00,190 --> 00:40:01,510
Afraid I'll get lost again?

426
00:40:00,990 --> 00:40:03,120
♪ Completely erase ♪

427
00:40:03,190 --> 00:40:04,360
What do you mean "again"?

428
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:07,480
♪ The certainty of my hand in yours ♪

429
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:07,670
Maybe we really

430
00:40:07,670 --> 00:40:09,970
♪ You are so clear ♪

431
00:40:08,150 --> 00:40:09,360
once got separated.

432
00:40:10,090 --> 00:40:12,100
♪ So close and so clear ♪

433
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,030
It's okay.

434
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,920
Even if we get separated this second,

435
00:40:12,740 --> 00:40:15,090
♪ If you possibly ♪

436
00:40:14,190 --> 00:40:15,070
in the next,

437
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:16,400
I will find you.

438
00:40:15,210 --> 00:40:17,300
♪ Still have the courage ♪

439
00:40:17,390 --> 00:40:23,000
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

440
00:40:23,710 --> 00:40:24,920
Where are we going?

441
00:40:23,980 --> 00:40:26,410
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

442
00:40:26,520 --> 00:40:30,050
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

443
00:40:27,110 --> 00:40:28,570
To the place where my heart

444
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:31,030
started beating for you again.

445
00:40:40,110 --> 00:40:42,820
♪ Time has a way of smoothing away ♪

446
00:40:42,930 --> 00:40:44,720
♪ The past ♪

447
00:40:45,020 --> 00:40:47,730
♪ The past that had you ♪

448
00:40:47,750 --> 00:40:50,350
♪ I pretend not to remember you ♪

449
00:40:50,590 --> 00:40:52,890
♪ If I really can't remember you ♪

450
00:40:53,020 --> 00:40:55,910
♪ I'll start loving you all over again ♪

451
00:40:55,930 --> 00:40:57,910
♪ From the day I forget you ♪

452
00:40:58,230 --> 00:41:00,790
♪ You are so clear ♪

453
00:41:00,810 --> 00:41:02,910
♪ So close and so clear ♪

454
00:41:03,630 --> 00:41:05,770
♪ If you possibly ♪

455
00:41:05,790 --> 00:41:08,050
♪ Still have the courage ♪

456
00:41:08,070 --> 00:41:13,030
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

457
00:41:14,200 --> 00:41:16,650
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

458
00:41:16,730 --> 00:41:22,470
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

459
00:41:23,450 --> 00:41:25,690
♪ Having loved you deeply ♪

460
00:41:25,830 --> 00:41:29,210
♪ Was the best decision I've made ♪

461
00:41:27,720 --> 00:41:31,870
[From Nancheng to Beicheng]

462
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:49,830
[The End]
